---
description: Delete and soft-delete only when the user explicitly deletes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Deletion

Never delete or soft-delete (`deletedAt`) unless the user **explicitly** deletes that entity (`remove`, `deleteCart`, `deleteCartItem`, …).

Do **not** set `deletedAt` to mean placed, completed, cancelled-in-spirit, hidden, or archived.

**Only exception:** a `CartItemEntity` with `quantity == 0` at checkout (`prepareCheckout`) may set `deletedAt`. That is the sole implicit soft-delete.

Checkout Complete finalizes the cart with `placedAt`, never `deletedAt`.
